# Review

A finding is a seed, not the report. Search the whole family before writing 应改 / 可改. The list must be every instance, not a sample.

Sweep by invariant, not by the file in view. For each finding, grep siblings before listing:

- Tables that can drift (edition names, 篇, axes, legal PDFs)
- Dead exports, unused params, leftover attributes
- HTML tags or UI copy built in TypeScript
- Empty 校记 / 今译 / 按语 still emitting a headed section
- Print pages carrying web-only attrs or a second script

If that family was already swept, do not re-report the next sibling next round. That means the last review was incomplete.

应改: wrong output, conflicting flags accepted, empty shells, two sources that can drift.  
可改: a consistency pass already taken across the family. Do not file "the next union could also be derived."
